            {
                "entry_id": "e639b52e-af64-3eb3-be24-1c98839226bd",
                "word": "incognito",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                        "entry_id": "e639b52e-af64-3eb3-be24-1c98839226bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sans être connu. Il se dit en parlant des personnes, qui, en pays étranger, ne voulant pas être connues, ou traitées selon leur dignité, n’ont pas leur train ordinaire ou leurs autres marques distinctives, et qui le plus souvent prennent un autre nom, un autre titre que le leur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86fe05e0-d65e-49b5-a089-df3d42b0ba05",
                                "sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                                "text": "Cet acteur passa incognito par la France."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ab97545-4ddd-4ea6-b0be-bcf4460246be",
                                "sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                                "text": "Il séjourna incognito à Rome."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "085193e9-ee9c-4377-9894-bb99a1735693",
                                "sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                                "text": "Le roi d’Espagne voyageait alors incognito, sous le nom de duc de Tolède."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e106c12-2b34-46b3-a1a5-4466d42f717f",
                                "sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                                "text": "Je suis à Paris incognito, et je n’y vois personne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02c6dbee-4e8a-4d02-872e-b97448f3e05f",
                                "sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                                "text": "On l’avait invité à se rendre à Issoire « pour prendre des mesures ». Il répondait que c’était inutile ; qu’au cours d’un voyage « incognito », il avait examiné de près le socle et le cheval de bronze ; qu’il possédait à ce sujet, des notes abondantes et précises, et que tout irait parfaitement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "58ee75f7-0138-419b-b998-0608fa6d0951",
                        "source_entry_id": "e639b52e-af64-3eb3-be24-1c98839226bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                        "target_lang_word": "incognito",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incognito",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92d145b1-d96c-3b2c-a791-c3c4f18c4489",
                                        "entry_id": "f442e83c-0d67-3886-a11b-9ad66f7b300f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without being known; in an assumed character, or under an assumed title; in disguise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1db4405f-9cd1-42d6-ac5a-ebf07edfc56d",
                                                "sense_id": "92d145b1-d96c-3b2c-a791-c3c4f18c4489",
                                                "text": "THE Scepticks think 'twas long ago, / Since Gods came down Incognito; / To ſee who were their Friends or Foes, / And how our Actions fell or roſe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incognito",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab8439ac-a279-3fc4-9cec-9cd1dc4c43ac",
                                        "entry_id": "c2a2d360-aef5-31d3-a9f1-5c211a8d2405",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without revealing one's identity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d563eb45-9e69-45a3-b271-7d93c0a490c0",
                                                "sense_id": "ab8439ac-a279-3fc4-9cec-9cd1dc4c43ac",
                                                "text": "The prince royal of Prussia came thither incognito."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a6ef004-2028-4b5c-919b-36cf36694ca6",
                                                "sense_id": "ab8439ac-a279-3fc4-9cec-9cd1dc4c43ac",
                                                "text": "\"But you can understand,\" said our strange visitor, sitting down once more and passing his hand over his high white forehead, \"you can understand that I am not accustomed to doing such business in my own person. Yet the matter was so delicate that I could not confide it to an agent without putting myself in his power. I have come incognito from Prague for the purpose of consulting you.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incognito",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58fdf521-f781-34d0-8341-313eebb0ec10",
                                        "entry_id": "b3e4bb7d-b987-3dd7-b77c-b94763618e7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One unknown or in disguise, or under an assumed character or name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c75e422c-1c4e-3cc8-b98e-e96433d9a2c1",
                                        "entry_id": "b3e4bb7d-b987-3dd7-b77c-b94763618e7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The assumption of disguise or of a feigned character; the state of being in disguise or not recognized."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f5caa18-aa2e-409e-a7d3-baa79dc9e33f",
                                                "sense_id": "c75e422c-1c4e-3cc8-b98e-e96433d9a2c1",
                                                "text": "Of those letters, and other attempts of the same kind, the author could not complain, though his incognito was endangered. He had challenged the public to a game at bo-peep, and if he was discovered in his “hiding-hole,” he must submit to the shame of detection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46324590-2086-4de0-b3c6-0c7fccddc8ba",
                                                "sense_id": "c75e422c-1c4e-3cc8-b98e-e96433d9a2c1",
                                                "text": "It contained a letter from the King himself, craving hospitality for a few days, as his mother was about to visit England, and to take up with Lord Avonleigh her residence at the Castle. A slight incognito would be preserved, and as little form and ceremony expected as was possible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4eae1a66-02e5-4408-ba3d-b7a05d3716da",
                        "source_entry_id": "e639b52e-af64-3eb3-be24-1c98839226bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                        "target_lang_word": "un incognito",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aca3617f-908e-4b94-a95c-45cf63ef014d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e639b52e-af64-3eb3-be24-1c98839226bd",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8fd853a-0708-366b-86d1-c7ab7a354e00",
                        "target_lang_word": "инкогнито",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "инкогнито",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5bdb397-1e80-3fbf-ab78-242d22583cfb",
                                        "entry_id": "0c4700f2-cb2e-36a4-8100-9a53cabdb0a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "анонимно или под вымышленным именем; сохраняя тайну своей личности"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a319a122-95b3-4225-9c37-c9d98c16e11d",
                                                "sense_id": "c5bdb397-1e80-3fbf-ab78-242d22583cfb",
                                                "text": "Во главе посольства стал Лефорт и Фёдор Головин; сам Пётр I был членом посольства и путешествовал инкогнито под именем Петра Михайлова."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "инкогнито",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3392e2f-8601-3fd4-ac88-f9175ec79caa",
                                        "entry_id": "8123e8df-9a79-34fe-84cc-1e3edcef7836",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "тот, чья личность сохраняется в тайне"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b71051f-f6e6-41b4-a3f2-a9647b1bf7bb",
                                                "sense_id": "f3392e2f-8601-3fd4-ac88-f9175ec79caa",
                                                "text": "Наш инкогнито не был комедийным актером, но один смешной эксцентрический фильм с его участием известен всем."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38fe8cab-c617-393e-b4fb-2a7c1c9a82b6",
                                        "entry_id": "8123e8df-9a79-34fe-84cc-1e3edcef7836",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "тайна такой личности"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "498e3226-9d67-4ad4-bc6a-f22a8f64e646",
                                                "sense_id": "38fe8cab-c617-393e-b4fb-2a7c1c9a82b6",
                                                "text": "Адвокат обвинил власти в циничном пренебрежении достоинством Келли, поскольку они сначала раскрыли его инкогнито, а затем довели его разбирательствами до самоубийства."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2eb2c00-5dc4-4cc8-bf50-a1817b858080",
                        "source_entry_id": "e639b52e-af64-3eb3-be24-1c98839226bd",
